# A nested full clone of this repo (its own .git + node_modules + .env.local).
# Left unignored it would be swept into any `git add -A` and could commit a
# duplicate tree plus a real .env.local. Delete it, don't commit it.
/Puntakit-kalasin/

# One-off admin-credential helper (its own header says TEMP). It writes merged
# JWT_SECRET / ADMIN_PASSWORD values to a temp file, so it must never be tracked.
_merge-env.mjs

# Local agent/tooling scaffolding: swarm harnesses, generated skill packs and
# runtime state. Machine-local config — not app code.
# Exception: .agents/skills is the committed source of truth for skill packs and must
# stay trackable — without this negation, newly added skill files are silently ignored.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.claude-flow/
.swarm/
.freebuff/
.mcp.json
skills-lock.json

# Added by the Vercel CLI when linking this folder to a project.
.vercel
.env*
# Re-asserted after the broader `.env*` above so the documented template stays
# visible in the repo.
!.env.example
